      - startSeconds: 45.066
        endSeconds: 46.226
        text: insect.
    quiz:
      id: quiz_bm_ea74
      contentVersion: 1
      questions:
      - id: bm_ea74_q1
        correctOptionId: bm_ea74_q1_d
        prompt:
          fr: "Dans quelle pierre le scarab\xE9e monumental est-il sculpt\xE9 ?"
          ar: "\u0645\u0646 \u0623\u064A \u062D\u062C\u0631 \u0646\u064F\u062D\u062A \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0636\u062E\u0645\u061F"
          en: Which stone was used for the monumental scarab?
        explanation:
          fr: "Le scarab\xE9e EA74 est sculpt\xE9 dans la diorite. Il faut distinguer sa mati\xE8re de celle du lion en granite rouge ou de la pierre de Rosette en granodiorite."
          ar: "\u0646\u064F\u062D\u062A \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0646 EA74 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062F\u064A\u0648\u0631\u064A\u062A\u060C \u0648\u0647\u0648 \u064A\u062E\u062A\u0644\u0641 \u0639\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u0646\u064A\u062A \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062D\u0645\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062A\u062E\u062F\u0645 \u0641\u064A \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0633\u062F \u0648\u0639\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u0646\u0648\u062F\u064A\u0648\u0631\u064A\u062A \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062A\u062E\u062F\u0645 \u0641\u064A \u062D\u062C\u0631 \u0631\u0634\u064A\u062F."
          en: Scarab EA74 is carved from diorite. This differs from the red granite of the lion and the granodiorite of the Rosetta Stone.
        options:
        - id: bm_ea74_q1_a
          text:
            fr: Granite rouge
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u0646\u064A\u062A \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062D\u0645\u0631"
            en: Red granite
        - id: bm_ea74_q1_b
          text:
            fr: Marbre
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u0631\u062E\u0627\u0645"
            en: Marble
        - id: bm_ea74_q1_c
          text:
            fr: Granodiorite
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u0646\u0648\u062F\u064A\u0648\u0631\u064A\u062A"
            en: Granodiorite
        - id: bm_ea74_q1_d
          text:
            fr: Diorite
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u062F\u064A\u0648\u0631\u064A\u062A"
            en: Diorite
      - id: bm_ea74_q2
        correctOptionId: bm_ea74_q2_a
        prompt:
          fr: "Quel dieu ce scarab\xE9e repr\xE9sente-t-il probablement ?"
          ar: "\u0623\u064A \u0625\u0644\u0647 \u064A\u064F\u0631\u062C\u062D \u0623\u0646 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u064A\u0645\u062B\u0644\u0647\u061F"
          en: Which god does this scarab probably represent?
        explanation:
          fr: "La notice identifie probablement Kh\xE9pri, une forme du dieu solaire. Cette attribution reste formul\xE9e comme une probabilit\xE9."
          ar: "\u062A\u064F\u0631\u062C\u062D \u0628\u0637\u0627\u0642\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0637\u0639\u0629 \u0623\u0646\u0647\u0627 \u062A\u0645\u062B\u0644 \u062E\u0628\u0631\u064A\u060C \u0648\u0647\u0648 \u0635\u0648\u0631\u0629 \u0645\u0646 \u0635\u0648\u0631 \u0625\u0644\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0645\u0633. \u0648\u062A\u0638\u0644 \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0633\u0628\u0629 \u0627\u062D\u062A\u0645\u0627\u0644\u064A\u0629."
          en: The description identifies Khepri, a form of the sun god, as the probable subject. This attribution remains a probability.
        options:
        - id: bm_ea74_q2_a
          text:
            fr: "Kh\xE9pri"
            ar: "\u062E\u0628\u0631\u064A"
            en: Khepri
        - id: bm_ea74_q2_b
          text:
            fr: Amon
            ar: "\u0622\u0645\u0648\u0646"
            en: Amun
        - id: bm_ea74_q2_c
          text:
            fr: Nout
            ar: "\u0646\u0648\u062A"
            en: Nut
        - id: bm_ea74_q2_d
          text:
            fr: "Ptol\xE9m\xE9e V"
            ar: "\u0628\u0637\u0644\u064A\u0645\u0648\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u062E\u0627\u0645\u0633"
            en: Ptolemy V
      - id: bm_ea74_q3
        correctOptionId: bm_ea74_q3_c
        prompt:
          fr: "\xC0 quel moment du cycle solaire Kh\xE9pri est-il associ\xE9 ?"
          ar: "\u0628\u0623\u064A \u0645\u0631\u062D\u0644\u0629 \u0645\u0646 \u062F\u0648\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0645\u0633 \u064A\u0631\u062A\u0628\u0637 \u062E\u0628\u0631\u064A\u061F"
          en: Which part of the solar cycle is Khepri associated with?
        explanation:
          fr: "Kh\xE9pri est associ\xE9 au soleil levant. Dans la narration, le scarab\xE9e \xE9voque la naissance et le renouvellement."
          ar: "\u064A\u0631\u062A\u0628\u0637 \u062E\u0628\u0631\u064A \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0634\u0645\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0631\u0642\u0629. \u0648\u0641\u064A \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0631\u062F\u060C \u064A\u0631\u0645\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0644\u0627\u062F\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062A\u062C\u062F\u062F."
          en: Khepri is associated with the rising sun. In the narration, the scarab evokes birth and renewal.
        options:
        - id: bm_ea74_q3_a
          text:
            fr: Au soleil de midi
            ar: "\u0634\u0645\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0638\u0647\u064A\u0631\u0629"
            en: The midday sun
        - id: bm_ea74_q3_b
          text:
            fr: Au soleil couchant
            ar: "\u063A\u0631\u0648\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0645\u0633"
            en: The setting sun
        - id: bm_ea74_q3_c
          text:
            fr: Au soleil levant
            ar: "\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0645\u0633"
            en: The rising sun
        - id: bm_ea74_q3_d
          text:
            fr: "Aux \xE9clipses uniquement"
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u0643\u0633\u0648\u0641 \u0641\u0642\u0637"
            en: Eclipses only
  - id: bm_ea1779
    title: "B\xE9lier d\u2019Amon prot\xE9geant Taharqa"
    summary: "Le dieu Amon repr\xE9sent\xE9 sous la forme d\u2019un b\xE9lier abritant le roi Taharqa."
    description: "Cette statue repr\xE9sente Amon sous la forme d\u2019un b\xE9lier couch\xE9. Entre ses pattes avant se tient une petite figure du roi Taharqa, plac\xE9 sous sa protection. L\u2019objet, conserv\xE9 au British Museum sous le num\xE9ro EA1779, provient de Kawa en Nubie. Des hi\xE9roglyphes parcourent sa base rectangulaire."
    museumObjectId: EA1779
    photoCredit: M0tty
    photoLicence: CC-BY-SA-3.0
    photoSource: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Granite_ram_of_Amun_with_King_Taharqa_-_British_Museum.jpg
    modelLicence: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
    modelSource: https://github.com/BritishMuseumDH/DH-OculusVR-models
    modelCredits:
    - Daniel Pett
    - Jennifer Wexler
    - Thomas Flynn
    - Copyright Trustees of the British Museum
    descriptionSources:
    - https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/statue-of-the-ram-of-amun-35d49b6d599045d6ba1dd41999b0012e
    - https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Granite_ram_of_Amun_with_King_Taharqa_-_British_Museum.jpg
    photograph: {fileID: 2800000, guid: fb513995543ac448a958ac22cc713b49, type: 3}
    modelPrefab: {fileID: 1453640129851508044, guid: 7d30b43447bd443e19dc251be609b84c, type: 3}
    targetWidthMeters: 0.12
    audio:
    - id: bm_ea1779.narration.fr
      language: fr
      kind: narration
      transcript: "Cette statue repr\xE9sente le dieu Amon sous la forme d\u2019un b\xE9lier couch\xE9. Entre ses pattes avant se trouve une petite figure du roi Taharqa, plac\xE9e sous sa protection. L\u2019\u0153uvre provient du temple d\u2019Amon \xE0 Kawa, dans l\u2019actuel Soudan. Observez le contraste entre le grand animal et le souverain, puis les inscriptions sur la base. Cette composition exprime une relation entre le pouvoir royal et la protection divine, dans l\u2019histoire de la Nubie et de l\u2019\xC9gypte."
      voiceId: 6DEjyaHWnTHsvXM5Byys
      modelId: eleven_multilingual_v2
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb4cf50a08c4549d28f85acfd3e172ca, type: 3}
      subtitles:
      - startSeconds: 0.08
        endSeconds: 0.961
        text: Cette statue
      - startSeconds: 1.581
        endSeconds: 4.683
        text: "repr\xE9sente le dieu Amon sous\nla forme d\u2019un b\xE9lier"
      - startSeconds: 4.683
        endSeconds: 5.483
        text: "couch\xE9."
      - startSeconds: 5.864
        endSeconds: 9.127
        text: 'Entre ses pattes avant se

          trouve une petite figure du'
      - startSeconds: 9.127
        endSeconds: 12.049
        text: "roi Taharqa, plac\xE9e sous sa\nprotection."
      - startSeconds: 12.529
        endSeconds: 16.032
        text: "L\u2019\u0153uvre provient du temple\nd\u2019Amon \xE0 Kawa, dans l\u2019actuel"
      - startSeconds: 16.032
        endSeconds: 20.295
        text: 'Soudan. Observez le contraste

          entre le grand animal et'
      - startSeconds: 20.295
        endSeconds: 23.497
        text: 'le souverain, puis les

          inscriptions sur la base.'
      - startSeconds: 24.558
        endSeconds: 27.38
        text: 'Cette composition exprime

          une relation entre le pouvoir'
      - startSeconds: 27.4
        endSeconds: 30.522
        text: "royal et la protection\ndivine, dans l\u2019histoire de la"
      - startSeconds: 30.522
        endSeconds: 31.783
        text: "Nubie et de l\u2019\xC9gypte."
    - id: bm_ea1779.audio_description.fr
      language: fr
      kind: audio_description
      transcript: "Un grand b\xE9lier est couch\xE9 sur une base rectangulaire. Ses pattes sont repli\xE9es sous son corps et sa t\xEAte est relev\xE9e. Une petite figure humaine se tient entre les pattes avant. Elle para\xEEt minuscule face \xE0 l\u2019animal. Des rang\xE9es de signes grav\xE9s parcourent les c\xF4t\xE9s de la base."
      voiceId: 6DEjyaHWnTHsvXM5Byys
