        text: "the shoulders and the variations\nin the stone\u2019s colour."
      - startSeconds: 21.885
        endSeconds: 23.365
        text: Even as a fragment,
      - startSeconds: 24.565
        endSeconds: 28.566
        text: 'this sculpture retains a

          powerful presence.'
      - startSeconds: 29.886
