        text: 'It shows how monuments could

          make royal authority'
      - startSeconds: 35.247
        endSeconds: 36.047
        text: visible
      - startSeconds: 36.928
        endSeconds: 41.449
        text: "and connect the ruler\u2019s\nimage with sacred spaces."
    - id: bm_ea19.audio_description.en
      language: en
      kind: audio_description
      transcript: "The sculpture preserves a human head and upper torso. A striped headdress frames the face and extends down onto the shoulders. Missing parts make the torso\u2019s outline uneven. The stone varies in colour. The figure faces forward, giving particular prominence to the face."
      voiceId: 3ADZQUoqg3hWyEOlzpXW
      modelId: eleven_multilingual_v2
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bfe21c05edd7d46938654eb95228258b, type: 3}
