        text: 'giving particular prominence

          to the face.'
    quiz:
      id: quiz_bm_ea19
      contentVersion: 1
      questions:
      - id: bm_ea19_q1
        correctOptionId: bm_ea19_q1_c
        prompt:
          fr: "Comment s\u2019appelle la coiffe ray\xE9e port\xE9e par Rams\xE8s II ?"
          ar: "\u0645\u0627 \u0627\u0633\u0645 \u063A\u0637\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0623\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062E\u0637\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u0630\u064A \u064A\u0631\u062A\u062F\u064A\u0647 \u0631\u0645\u0633\u064A\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u062B\u0627\u0646\u064A\u061F"
          en: What is the striped headdress worn by Ramesses II called?
        explanation:
          fr: "Le n\xE9m\xE8s est la coiffe ray\xE9e des pharaons. Sur ce buste, il encadre le visage et descend sur les \xE9paules."
          ar: "\u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0633 \u0647\u0648 \u063A\u0637\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0623\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062E\u0637\u0637 \u0644\u0644\u0641\u0631\u0627\u0639\u0646\u0629. \u0648\u0641\u064A \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062A\u0645\u062B\u0627\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0635\u0641\u064A\u060C \u064A\u062D\u064A\u0637 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0648\u062C\u0647 \u0648\u064A\u0645\u062A\u062F \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u062A\u0641\u064A\u0646."
          en: The nemes is the striped headdress of the pharaohs. On this bust, it frames the face and extends over the shoulders.
        options:
        - id: bm_ea19_q1_a
          text:
            fr: "Le d\xE9motique"
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u062F\u064A\u0645\u0648\u0637\u064A\u0642\u064A\u0629"
            en: Demotic
        - id: bm_ea19_q1_b
          text:
            fr: "Le scarab\xE9e"
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u062C\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0646"
            en: Scarab
        - id: bm_ea19_q1_c
          text:
            fr: "Le n\xE9m\xE8s"
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0633"
            en: Nemes
        - id: bm_ea19_q1_d
          text:
            fr: Le sarcophage
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u062A\u0627\u0628\u0648\u062A"
            en: Sarcophagus
      - id: bm_ea19_q2
        correctOptionId: bm_ea19_q2_b
        prompt:
          fr: "De quel monument ce fragment de Rams\xE8s II provient-il ?"
          ar: "\u0645\u0646 \u0623\u064A \u0645\u0639\u0644\u0645 \u062C\u0627\u0621 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0632\u0621 \u0645\u0646 \u062A\u0645\u062B\u0627\u0644 \u0631\u0645\u0633\u064A\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u062B\u0627\u0646\u064A\u061F"
          en: Which monument did this fragment of Ramesses II come from?
        explanation:
          fr: "Ce fragment provient du Ramesseum, le temple fun\xE9raire de Rams\xE8s II \xE0 Th\xE8bes."
          ar: "\u062C\u0627\u0621 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0632\u0621 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0627\u0645\u0633\u064A\u0648\u0645\u060C \u0648\u0647\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0628\u062F \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0646\u0627\u0626\u0632\u064A \u0644\u0631\u0645\u0633\u064A\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u062B\u0627\u0646\u064A \u0641\u064A \u0637\u064A\u0628\u0629."
          en: This fragment comes from the Ramesseum, the mortuary temple of Ramesses II at Thebes.
        options:
        - id: bm_ea19_q2_a
          text:
            fr: "Du temple d\u2019Amon \xE0 Kawa"
            ar: "\u0645\u0639\u0628\u062F \u0622\u0645\u0648\u0646 \u0641\u064A \u0643\u0627\u0648\u0627"
            en: The temple of Amun at Kawa
        - id: bm_ea19_q2_b
          text:
            fr: "Du Ramesseum \xE0 Th\xE8bes"
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u0631\u0627\u0645\u0633\u064A\u0648\u0645 \u0641\u064A \u0637\u064A\u0628\u0629"
            en: The Ramesseum at Thebes
        - id: bm_ea19_q2_c
          text:
            fr: "De la mosqu\xE9e Ibn Touloun"
            ar: "\u0645\u0633\u062C\u062F \u0627\u0628\u0646 \u0637\u0648\u0644\u0648\u0646"
            en: The Ibn Tulun Mosque
        - id: bm_ea19_q2_d
          text:
            fr: Du socle des lions de Prudhoe
            ar: "\u0642\u0627\u0639\u062F\u0629 \u0623\u0633\u062F\u064A \u0628\u0631\u0648\u062F\u0647\u0648"
            en: The pedestal of the Prudhoe Lions
      - id: bm_ea19_q3
        correctOptionId: bm_ea19_q3_d
        prompt:
          fr: "Quelles parties de la statue sont conserv\xE9es dans ce fragment ?"
          ar: "\u0623\u064A \u0623\u062C\u0632\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u062A\u0645\u062B\u0627\u0644 \u0628\u0642\u064A\u062A \u0641\u064A \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0637\u0639\u0629\u061F"
          en: Which parts of the statue survive in this fragment?
        explanation:
          fr: "EA19 conserve la t\xEAte et le haut du corps d\u2019une statue colossale. Les parties manquantes expliquent les contours irr\xE9guliers du fragment."
          ar: "\u062A\u062D\u062A\u0641\u0638 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0637\u0639\u0629 EA19 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0631\u0623\u0633 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062C\u0632\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0644\u0648\u064A \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0633\u0645 \u0645\u0646 \u062A\u0645\u062B\u0627\u0644 \u0636\u062E\u0645. \u0648\u062A\u0641\u0633\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062C\u0632\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0641\u0642\u0648\u062F\u0629 \u062D\u062F\u0648\u062F \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0637\u0639\u0629 \u063A\u064A\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062A\u0638\u0645\u0629."
          en: "EA19 preserves the head and upper body of a colossal statue. Missing parts account for the fragment\u2019s uneven outline."
        options:
        - id: bm_ea19_q3_a
          text:
            fr: Les pieds uniquement
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u0642\u062F\u0645\u0627\u0646 \u0641\u0642\u0637"
            en: Only the feet
        - id: bm_ea19_q3_b
          text:
            fr: Le corps entier
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u062C\u0633\u0645 \u0643\u0627\u0645\u0644\u0627\u064B"
            en: The entire body
        - id: bm_ea19_q3_c
          text:
            fr: Les mains et les jambes
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u064A\u062F\u0627\u0646 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0633\u0627\u0642\u0627\u0646"
            en: The hands and legs
        - id: bm_ea19_q3_d
          text:
            fr: "La t\xEAte et le haut du corps"
            ar: "\u0627\u0644\u0631\u0623\u0633 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062C\u0632\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0644\u0648\u064A \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0633\u0645"
            en: The head and upper body
  - id: bm_ea1
    title: "Lion de Prudhoe \u2014 EA1"
    summary: "Un lion de granite rouge associ\xE9 \xE0 Amenhotep III."
    description: "Cette sculpture en granite rouge repr\xE9sente un lion couch\xE9 et appartient \xE0 la paire des lions de Prudhoe. Elle est associ\xE9e au r\xE8gne d\u2019Amenhotep III. Des inscriptions sur le corps et le socle \xE9voquent plusieurs souverains, t\xE9moignant des r\xE9emplois de cette image du pouvoir royal."
    museumObjectId: EA1
    photoCredit: Szilas
    photoLicence: CC-BY-SA-4.0
    photoSource: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Red_granite_figure_of_a_lion_from_Gebel_Barkal.jpg
    modelLicence: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
    modelSource: https://github.com/BritishMuseumDH/DH-OculusVR-models
    modelCredits:
    - Daniel Pett
    - Jennifer Wexler
    - Thomas Flynn
    - Copyright Trustees of the British Museum
    descriptionSources:
    - https://github.com/BritishMuseumDH/DH-OculusVR-models/blob/master/labeldata/labeldata.csv
    photograph: {fileID: 2800000, guid: f90f16b3a83044e74b81614864414412, type: 3}
    modelPrefab: {fileID: 5903746491060840697, guid: 63403feb700bc45589b6462f8210e692, type: 3}
    targetWidthMeters: 0.12
    audio:
    - id: bm_ea1.narration.fr
      language: fr
      kind: narration
      transcript: "Ce lion couch\xE9, sculpt\xE9 dans le granite rouge, appartient \xE0 la paire appel\xE9e les lions de Prudhoe. Il est associ\xE9 au r\xE8gne d\u2019Amenhotep trois. Son corps allong\xE9 repose sur un socle portant des inscriptions. Ces textes \xE9voquent plusieurs souverains et t\xE9moignent de la longue histoire de la sculpture. Observez la t\xEAte, les pattes et les signes grav\xE9s. L\u2019image du lion permettait d\u2019exprimer la force royale, tout en accordant une grande attention au corps de l\u2019animal."
      voiceId: 6DEjyaHWnTHsvXM5Byys
      modelId: eleven_flash_v2_5
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a5fdb17440a6040bfa15357567e3e8aa, type: 3}
