    - id: bm_ea1.audio_description.en
      language: en
      kind: audio_description
      transcript: A stone lion lies on a pedestal. Its elongated body has a modelled head and carved paws. Red granite gives the sculpture a warm colour. Inscriptions occupy the chest and several surfaces of the pedestal. The body has rounded forms, while the base has straight edges.
