    - id: bm_ea23.audio_description.en
      language: en
      kind: audio_description
      transcript: A large stone chest forms a hollow space open at the top. Its thick walls are covered with signs and figures in relief. More figures decorate the interior. A female figure, Nut, extends across the bottom of the chest. The overall form is an elongated container intended for a human body.
      voiceId: 3ADZQUoqg3hWyEOlzpXW
      modelId: eleven_flash_v2_5
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ecd681ddbfae438ab38840d309c3172, type: 3}
